@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Crear cliente
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Ana Pérez", "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-20", "gender": "Female", "monthlyIncome": 2500.00 }

### 2. Crear cuenta (reemplazar customerId)
POST {{host}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "initialBalance": 100.00 }

### 3. Saldo
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20260618-0000/balance

### 4. Depósito
POST {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20260618-0000/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 50.00 }

### 5. Retiro
POST {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20260618-0000/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 20.00 }

### 6. Historial
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20260618-0000/transactions
